# The CAD tree stays on the design machine. It is 64 MB of meshes and renders,
# it is done (all 17 parts printed and fitted), and nothing downstream needs it.
#
# EXCEPT the web-sized drawings: build.py inlines those 17 PNGs as data URIs, so
# without them the mission console cannot be rebuilt anywhere else. 336 KB, and
# it is the difference between the app being reproducible on the kit and not.
#
# Re-including a path under an ignored directory needs the ladder below - git
# will not look inside a directory it has already excluded, so each level has to
# be un-excluded in turn.
cad/*
!cad/renders/
cad/renders/*
!cad/renders/blueprints/
cad/renders/blueprints/*
!cad/renders/blueprints/web/

**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
